{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-sample-integration-methods","title":"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/multi-sample-integration-methods","wordCount":2976,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制\">多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当研究从「一个病人、一次建库」扩展到「多个供体、多个中心、多个时间点」时，矩阵里同时存在两种结构：<strong>真实的生物学差异</strong>（细胞类型、疾病状态、发育阶段）和<strong>非生物学技术差异</strong>（批次）。批次效应来自试剂盒批号、仪器校准、操作员、解离时长、测序流动槽，甚至建库当天实验室的温度。它在 UMAP 上表现为「同一个细胞类型被切成几个岛，岛按样本聚而不是按类型聚」。</p>\n<p>整合（integration）的目标不是「把批次差异全部抹掉」——那是过度矫正，会把真正关心的疾病效应也一并删除。正确的目标是：<strong>在保留生物学变异的前提下，使同一细胞类型跨批次的表达谱重叠</strong>。这两者是一对可以量化的张力，也是 scIB（single-cell integration benchmark）用两族指标同时衡量的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[多批次计数矩阵&lt;br/&gt;cell x gene x batch] --&gt; B[共同预处理&lt;br/&gt;归一化 + HVG + PCA]&#10;    B --&gt; C{整合策略选择}&#10;    C --&gt;|线性/嵌入校正| D[Harmony / Seurat RPCA / LIGER]&#10;    C --&gt;|概率生成模型| E[scVI / scANVI / scPoli]&#10;    C --&gt;|图连接| F[BBKNN / scVI kNN]&#10;    C --&gt;|参考映射| G[Symphony / scArches / Azimuth]&#10;    D --&gt; H[整合嵌入 latent]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[聚类 + 注释 + 轨迹推断]\">flowchart TD\n    A[多批次计数矩阵&lt;br/&gt;cell x gene x batch] --&gt; B[共同预处理&lt;br/&gt;归一化 + HVG + PCA]\n    B --&gt; C{整合策略选择}\n    C --&gt;|线性/嵌入校正| D[Harmony / Seurat RPCA / LIGER]\n    C --&gt;|概率生成模型| E[scVI / scANVI / scPoli]\n    C --&gt;|图连接| F[BBKNN / scVI kNN]\n    C --&gt;|参考映射| G[Symphony / scArches / Azimuth]\n    D --&gt; H[整合嵌入 latent]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[聚类 + 注释 + 轨迹推断]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法族</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n<th>在何处校正</th>\n<th>是否需要原始计数</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性嵌入校正</td>\n<td>Harmony、Seurat CCA/RPCA</td>\n<td>PCA 空间</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同组织、批次中等、追求速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率生成模型</td>\n<td>scVI、scANVI、scPoli</td>\n<td>计数似然层</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>批次多、需要批次不变量嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图连接</td>\n<td>BBKNN、scVI kNN</td>\n<td>近邻图</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>只要图、不需共享嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考映射</td>\n<td>Symphony、scArches、Azimuth</td>\n<td>投影到固定参考</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有参考图谱，新样本增量映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"批次效应的度量-扰动与保守两族指标\">批次效应的度量：扰动与保守两族指标</h2><p>判断整合好坏不能只看「岛有没有合并」。若一个方法把所有的岛合并成一大团、细胞类型也糊在一起，图上看很&quot;干净&quot;，但生物学信息已经丢失。scIB 框架（Luecken 等，<em>Nature Methods</em> 2022，doi:10.1038/s41592-021-01336-8）因此用两族互补指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>批次去除（batch removal）</strong>：kBET（检验细胞邻域内批次标签是否与全局分布一致，值越接近 1 越好）、iLISI（标签的逆辛普森指数，越小说明邻域批次越混匀越好）、批次 ASW、图谱连通性 graph connectivity。</li>\n<li><strong>生物学保守（bio conservation）</strong>：细胞类型 ASW、cLISI、ARI（与真实标签的调整兰德指数）、NMI（归一化互信息）、孤立标签保持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>没有任何单一方法在全部指标上夺冠，这正是关键工程结论：<strong>方法选择取决于你的下游任务关心什么</strong>。若要精确聚类与注释，优先生物学保守；若要做跨批次的比例比较（如病例 vs 对照的细胞占比），则批次去除的权重更高。一个可操作的启发是：先按目标任务的指标排序候选方法，再用另一个维度的指标做否决——只要生物学保守指标塌掉（ARI 显著低于未整合基线），即使批次去除漂亮也不可采用。</p>\n<p>设邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，全局批次比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，kBET 的检验统计量基于</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>b</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2_i = \\sum_{b} \\frac{(p_i(b) - \\pi(b))^2}{\\pi(b)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7932em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对每个细胞计算局部批次富集是否显著，再报告接受率，接受率越低表示批次残留越强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线性嵌入校正-harmony-的软聚类机制\">线性嵌入校正：Harmony 的软聚类机制</h2><p>Harmony（Korsunsky 等，<em>Nature Methods</em> 2019，doi:10.1038/s41592-019-0619-0）是现阶段应用最广的整合方法之一，原因是它<strong>在 PCA 空间操作、不接触原始计数</strong>，因此速度快、可扩展，且可套用在任何已经算好 PCA 的流程后面。</p>\n<p>它的机制可以拆成两步迭代：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>软 k-means 软聚类</strong>：对每个细胞给出它对每个簇的隶属概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ik}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而不是硬分配。多数据整合时每个批次有自己的聚类中心，从而使簇中心可以「每一批偏一点」。</li>\n<li><strong>线性校正</strong>：对每个簇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 和批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，计算该批次细胞相对簇中心的偏移，用一个线性因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 把细胞拉向簇的全局中心。核心是最大化的目标函数</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>Z</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{Z} \\sum_{i,k} R_{ik} \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\lVert \\tilde{z}_i - o_{kb} \\rVert^2}{\\sigma^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9293em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{z}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是校正后的嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_{kb}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是簇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 在批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的中心。</p>\n<p>工程上要注意两个参数：<code>theta</code>（批次矫正强度，默认 2）和 <code>nclust</code>（软聚类数，默认在 100 量级）。<code>theta</code> 调大会更强力地拉平批次，但也会开始吞掉小的生物学差异；对细胞类型数多、簇间距离近的数据集（如免疫细胞亚群），把 <code>nclust</code> 设得过小会让两个真实亚群共享一个中心而被误合并。Harmony 的经验用法是：先在未整合数据上估计合理的簇数，再让 Harmony 的 <code>nclust</code> 取该数量的若干倍。</p>\n<p>与 Harmony 同族的还有 Seurat 的 CCA 与 RPCA 整合。CCA 寻找跨数据集的共享相关结构，对差异极大的数据集（跨物种、跨组织）能对齐更多共享信号，但计算代价随数据集数量增长；RPCA 用每个数据集自己的锚点投影到共享空间，速度更快，在数据集数量多、差异中等时通常是首选。二者都依赖「锚点（anchors）」——通过相互近邻（mutual nearest neighbors）识别的跨数据集对应细胞对，然后用这些锚点计算校正向量。锚点数过少意味着两个数据集缺少足够的共同细胞类型，此时强行整合会产生伪造的对应关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率生成模型-scvi-scanvi-与计数层建模\">概率生成模型：scVI、scANVI 与计数层建模</h2><p>Harmony 类方法把细胞先压成 PCA 再校正，丢弃了计数的离散性（负二项/泊松噪声）。scVI（Lopez 等，<em>Nature Methods</em> 2018，doi:10.1038/s41592-018-0229-5）改成直接在<strong>原始计数上</strong>建模：用变分自编码器（VAE）把每个细胞的表达映射到低维隐变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，同时把批次作为已知协变量输入解码器。</p>\n<p>其生成过程可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>μ</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>σ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_n \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, I), \\quad \\ell_n \\sim \\mathrm{LogNormal}(l_\\mu, l_\\sigma), \\quad x_{ng} \\sim \\mathrm{NB}\\!\\left(\\ell_n \\rho_{ng},\\ \\theta_g\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">LogNormal</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{ng}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是解码器从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与批次标识推出的归一化表达，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基因特异离散度。因为批次只进入解码器而不进入编码器，隐变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 被迫学习<strong>批次不变量</strong>的表征，天然适合下游聚类。</p>\n<p>scANVI 是 scVI 的半监督扩展：在 scVI 预训练后，把已注释细胞类型作为标签、未注释细胞作为未观测变量，联合训练一个分类头，使嵌入同时对齐细胞类型标签。工程上它的价值在于<strong>标签迁移</strong>——用一小部分已注释细胞引导整个数据集的注释。scPoli（Donno 等，<em>Nature Methods</em> 2023，doi:10.1038/s41592-023-01940-w）进一步引入「样本/条件嵌入」，允许模型外推到训练时未见过的样本，适合大图谱里样本数极多、需要留一法验证的场景。</p>\n<p>这几类模型对<strong>原始计数</strong>敏感，因此必须在归一化之前进入流程，且不应把已经做过 SCTransform 或 CPM 的浮点矩阵喂进去——负二项似然假设的是整数计数。这与本 hub 中预处理管线的顺序强相关，见 <a href=\"../preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/normalization-hvg-model\">归一化与高变基因建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图连接与参考映射-把新样本投射到已有图谱\">图连接与参考映射：把新样本投射到已有图谱</h2><p>有些流程并不需要一张全局嵌入，只需要一张「邻居里不带批次偏好」的 kNN 图。BBKNN（Polański 等，<em>Bioinformatics</em> 2020，doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btz625）的做法是：对每个细胞，在每个批次内部各取固定数量的最近邻，再把这些跨批次邻居拼成一张图。这样聚类算法在图上游走时不会因为某个批次细胞多而偏向该批次，速度极快，代价是没有可解释的共享嵌入，无法直接做跨批次的连续量（如拟时序）比较。</p>\n<p>参考映射是整合的另一极：不重新整合，而是把一个固定的参考图谱当作坐标系，把新样本投影进去。Symphony（Kang 等，<em>Nature Communications</em> 2021，doi:10.1038/s41467-021-25960-2）预计算参考的软聚类与簇中心，新查询细胞只需做一次 Harmony 式投影即可定位到参考空间，因此内存与时间开销与查询规模成正比而非与参考规模成正比——在百万细胞级参考上，投影几万新细胞的成本是可接受的。Azimuth 与 scArches（Lotfollahi 等，<em>Nature Biotechnology</em> 2022，doi:10.1038/s41587-021-01001-7）走的是同一路线，后者基于 scVI 架构，支持对参考模型做外科式（surgical）微调后投影新数据。</p>\n<p>参考映射的工程风险是<strong>参考偏倚</strong>：如果参考图谱里没有新样本中的某个细胞类型，投影会把它强行塞进最近的参考簇，而不是报告「这是新类型」。因此参考映射之后必须检查查询细胞的投影置信度与最近参考簇的距离分布，出现一批距离异常远的细胞时，应回退到从头整合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程决策清单\">工程决策清单</h2><p>多批次整合的失败往往不在算法，而在流程决策。以下顺序能避免大多数坑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>先诊断再矫正</strong>。在未整合的 PCA 上观察批次与细胞类型标签各自的分离程度，确认批次效应确实显著，并估计批次与生物学条件的混杂程度。若批次与条件完全混杂（每个病例一个批次），整合无法把两者分开——任何声称能分开的方法都是在做统计假设而非事实恢复。诊断方法见 <a href=\"../singlecell-assay-data-model/quality-control-batch-diagnosis\">细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>选择校正层级</strong>。保留原始计数的概率模型放在流程前端；PCA 之后的线性校正放在后端。混用会破坏似然假设。</li>\n<li><strong>确定整合粒度</strong>。是整合所有批次得到统一嵌入，还是保留一个参考、把后续样本逐个投影。前者适合一次性研究的联合分析，后者适合图谱的持续扩展。</li>\n<li><strong>用两族指标双向验证</strong>。批次去除指标达标但生物学保守塌陷 = 过度矫正；反之 = 矫正不足。二者同时改善才接受。</li>\n<li><strong>把参数写入方法学</strong>。Harmony 的 <code>theta</code>/<code>nclust</code>、scVI 的隐空间维度与训练轮数、BBKNN 的 <code>neighbors_within_batch</code> 都会改变结果，属于必须报告的参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个常被低估的替代方案是<strong>不做整合</strong>：当批次效应很小时，用「每批次做伪批量（pseudobulk）后按批次建模」的差异表达策略，比在单细胞层强行整合更不容易引入伪信号。对以差异表达为唯一目标的研究，伪批量往往比嵌入整合更稳健。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多样本整合的本质是一个<strong>偏差-方差权衡</strong>：校正得越强，批次去除越好，但生物学信号越可能被误删。Harmony 用 PCA 空间的软聚类线性校正换取速度与通用性；scVI/scANVI 用计数层的概率建模换取批次不变量表征与标签迁移；BBKNN 用图连接换取零嵌入依赖；Symphony/scArches 用参考投影换取增量扩展能力。选择依据不是「谁最好」，而是「下游任务要什么、有多少批次、有没有可复用的参考图谱」。与本 hub 的下一层分析衔接时，整合后的嵌入既可驱动聚类注释，也可作为轨迹推断的输入——但轨迹推断对整合质量格外敏感，跨批次的伪轨迹常来自残留批次效应而非真实的细胞状态转换。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制","id":"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"批次效应的度量：扰动与保守两族指标","id":"批次效应的度量-扰动与保守两族指标"},{"level":2,"text":"线性嵌入校正：Harmony 的软聚类机制","id":"线性嵌入校正-harmony-的软聚类机制"},{"level":2,"text":"概率生成模型：scVI、scANVI 与计数层建模","id":"概率生成模型-scvi-scanvi-与计数层建模"},{"level":2,"text":"图连接与参考映射：把新样本投射到已有图谱","id":"图连接与参考映射-把新样本投射到已有图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"工程决策清单","id":"工程决策清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"轨迹推断与 RNA 速率动力学模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/trajectory-rna-velocity-model"},"next":{"title":"参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/reference-atlas-label-transfer"}}